WEBVTT

00:04:59.112 --> 00:05:01.288
we create leather.

00:05:01.288 --> 00:05:03.482
And so I'm very excited to show you,

00:05:03.482 --> 00:05:05.631
for the first time,

00:05:05.631 --> 00:05:09.641
the first batch of our cultured leather,

00:05:09.641 --> 00:05:11.204
fresh from the lab.

00:05:11.204 --> 00:05:14.783
This is real, genuine leather,

00:05:14.783 --> 00:05:18.306
without the animal sacrifice.

00:05:18.306 --> 00:05:21.484
It can have all the characteristics of leather

00:05:21.484 --> 00:05:24.969
because it is made of the same cells,

00:05:24.969 --> 00:05:26.918
and better yet,

00:05:26.918 --> 00:05:30.793
there is no hair to remove,